OL,5,G2335 Shortscreen: The Curse
OL,6,     F1970s Kildare. Young Charlie is
OL,7,     F'mad to be a jockey' and enters
OL,8,     Finto a Faustian pact with local
OL,9,     Ftrainer Ted Webster Smith.
OL,10,G2350 The Last Anniversary
OL,11,     FAfter more frustrating encounters
OL,12,     Fwith the men on the island, Sophie
OL,13,     Fdecides it is time to leave.
OL,14,G0050 Mammoth
OL,15,     FMammoth's head teacher, Mr Cowley,
OL,16,     Fis signed off with stress, and
OL,17,     FMammoth wants him back. Meanwhile,
OL,18,     FMel arranges a big 18th-birthday
OL,19,     Fparty for Theo against his wishes.
